nts and curtain walls without compromising aesthetics.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What installation methods are supported for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display supports curtain and adhesive installation methods, enabling versatile mounting options for various structural requirements and facilitating seamless integration into glass surfaces.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the Transparent LED 3.8mm noisy during operation?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No, it is designed for silent operation with no fans required, making it perfect for quiet environments such as high-end retail and corporate buildings.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the product\\u2019s brightness compare to other transparent LED displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a brightness of 5,500 nits, it delivers superior visibility even under direct sunlight, outperforming many alternatives in maximizing content visibility without washing out.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of maintenance or service access does the product offer?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This LED display offers rear service access for easy maintenance, ensuring minimal disruption to installed fa\\u00e7ades or storefronts during servicing.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the Transparent LED 3.8mm suitable for outdoor use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it has an IP43 rating ensuring protection against dust and water spray, and has been tested to withstand wind loads up to 80 km/h, making it suitable for outdoor glass installations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty terms are available for this LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Warranty terms vary depending on the purchase agreement; typically, Brightluxx offers a comprehensive warranty covering manufacturing defects and performance with professional installation.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Transparent LED 3.8mm\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-trx380\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHour